On pathos_glove
    If player has 800250000
        Say "Ah, You chose Pathos' Glove. The Glove of Pathos comes in two varieties. Aurora of Basic Attack increases your attack power and Aurora of Defense increases your defense power. Which one would you like?"
        Topic "Attack Aurora" goto pathos_attack
        Topic "Defense Aurora" goto pathos_defense
        Topic "Back" goto greeting
    Else
        Say "You need Pathos' Glove Certificate to receive Patho's Glove. You can purchase Pathos' Glove Certificate from Power Up Store"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map power_up_item

